hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1271","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam ki bunyaad paanch chizon par rakhi gai hai: is baat ki gawahi ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, aur namaz qaim karna, aur zakaat dena, aur Baitullah ka hajj karna, aur Ramazan ke rozey rakhna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1272","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya phir farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak Allah ne tum par hajj farz kya hai isliye hajj karo. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Kya har saal ya Rasulullah? To Aap khamosh rahey, yahan tak ke us ne teen martaba kaha, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar main haan kehta to wajib ho jata aur tum iski taqat na rakhtey, phir farmaya: Mujhey us chiz par chhoro jis par main ne tumhey chhora hai, kyonke tum se pehley log apne kasrat se sawal karne aur apne ambiya se ikhtilaaf karne ki wjah se halaak huey, phir jab main tumhey kisi chiz ka hukm dun to us mein se jitna tum se ho sakey karo, aur jab main tumhey kisi chiz se mana karun to usey chhor do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1273","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya ke kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah aur uske Rasool par imaan lana. Kaha gaya: Phir kya? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke rastey mein jihad karna. Kaha gaya: Phir kya? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hajje mabroor. (Muttafaqun aleh). Mabroor wo hai jis ka karne wala us mein koi gunah ka irtikaab na karey."
"1274","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo shakhs hajj karey phir na behayai ki baat karey aur na gunah karey to wo aisa laut-ta hai jaisa us din tha jab uski maa ne usey jana tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1275","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik umrah se doosrey umrah tak darmiyani arsey ka kaffara hai, aur hajje mabroor ka badla Jannat ke siwa kuchh nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1276","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham jihad ko afzal amal samajhtey hain, to kya ham jihad na karein? To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumharey liye afzal jihad hajje mabroor hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1277","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Arafa ke din se badh kar koi din nahi jis mein Allah dozakh se bandon ko zyada aazaad karta ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1278","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan mein umrah mere sath hajj ke barabar hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1279","Unhin se riwayat hai ke aik aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ka apne bandon par hajj ka fariza merey walid ko aisi haalat mein paa gaya hai ke wo bahut boodhey hain, sawari par thehar nahi saktey, to kya main unki taraf se hajj karun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1280","Laqeet bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aey phir unhon-ne kaha: Beshak merey walid bahut boodhey hain, na hajj kar saktey hain aur na umrah, aur na safar kar saktey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne walid ki taraf se hajj aur umrah karo. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1281","Saaib bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hajjatul Wada mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath mujhey hajj karaya gaya jabke main saat saal ka tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1282","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rauha ke maqam par aik qafiley se mulaqat hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum kaun log ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Musalman. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap kaun hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke Rasool. To aik aurat ne aik bachchey ko uthaya phir kaha: Kya iske liye hajj hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan aur tumharey liye ajr hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1283","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne paalan par hajj kya aur wahi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka saamaan bhi tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1284","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ukaaz aur Mijanna aur Zul Majaaz zamana jahiliyat mein bazaar they, to unhon-ne mausamon mein tijarat karne se gunah samjha, to ye aayat nazil hui: Tum par koi gunah nahi ke tum apne Rab ka fazl talaash karo (Al-Baqarah: 198), hajj ke mausamon mein. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
